Common Type ClassRanking
    documentation 'The academic rank information of a student in relation to his or her graduating 
	'class. 
    integer ClassRank
        documentation 'The academic rank of a student in relation to his or her graduating class (e.g., 
        '1st, 2nd, 3rd).
        is required
    integer TotalNumberInClass
        documentation 'The total number of students in the student's graduating class.
        is required
    integer PercentageRanking
        documentation 'The academic percentage rank of a student in relation to his or her graduating 
        'class (e.g., 95%, 80%, 50%).
        is optional
    date ClassRankingDate
        documentation 'Date class ranking was determined.
        is optional
